Subject: [PATCH 8/11] dt-bindings: regulator: describe nested RPM-SMD resources

Document direct qcom,rpm-smd-regulator-resource children of the SMD RPM node,
including resource IDs, active/sleep sets, voltage-level and floor-level keys,
and the cooling-device subnodes present in the captured Khaje FDT. The shared
qcom,rpm-smd-regulator child compatible is explicitly described for both
physical PM6125 rails and generic RPM level votes. Add the resource-node pattern
to the parent SMD-RPM binding and provide DT constants for the common RPM level
values and regulator modes.

